{"title":"삼요정 SAY YA!!!","artist":"삼라만상","sourceId":"reference:Zmupm6qscVpcxaysq4mC","sourceHash":"e5cfece3cc806e8850809eeacfaaf4e819097c55b571582f9f43ef7d9764e96e","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":19.88,"end":22.88,"text":"はッ！Ha！はッ！Ha！そーれ！So-re！そーれ！So-re！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.92,"end":26.92,"text":"はッ！Ha！はッ！Ha！そいや！Soyya！そいや！Soyya！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":27.34,"end":30.34,"text":"はッ！Ha！はッ！Ha！そーれ！So-re！そーれ！So-re！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":30.54,"end":33.54,"text":"はッ！Ha！はッ！Ha！Soyya！Soyya！Soyya！Soyya！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":34.33,"end":37.33,"text":"瞳ギラギラ燃やせよ ここは戦場そいやそいや！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":39.99,"end":42.99,"text":"油断も隙もありんせん 息を合わせて三騎繚乱","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":46.59,"end":49.59,"text":"悪を成敗致します（致します） 忍び足でねそろりそろり！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":52.7,"end":55.47,"text":"立場さながらババンッと！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":55.47,"end":57.36,"text":"それ行け それ飛べ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":57.36,"end":58.83,"text":"いざ立ち上がれい！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":58.83,"end":61.83,"text":"ひらひらひら舞い踊る 心に花開く乙女","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":65.15,"end":68.15,"text":"弱き者たちよ 一つは三つ 三つは一つ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":71.74,"end":74.74,"text":"我が道をいざ行け！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":77.72,"end":80.72,"text":"三妖精YA! SAY YA! SAY YA!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":81.48,"end":84.48,"text":"ぐるぐる叫べ！ 一気に叩け！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":84.59,"end":87.59,"text":"三妖精YA! SAY YA! SAY YA!（SAY YA！嗚呼）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":88.3,"end":91.3,"text":"いざ攻め時 これが勝利の戦だ（舞い散れ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":94.35,"end":97.2,"text":"あたしら反旗の三妖精","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":97.2,"end":100.2,"text":"はッ！Ha！はッ！Ha！そーれ！So-re！そーれ！So-re！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":100.47999999999999,"end":103.47999999999999,"text":"はッ！Ha！はッ！Ha！そいや！Soyya！そいや！Soyya！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":103.86,"end":106.67,"text":"ひとつ！悪戯好きな日の光！ 三妖精","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":106.67,"end":109.67,"text":"ふたつ！静かなる月の光 三妖精","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":109.78,"end":112.78,"text":"みっつ！降り注ぐ星の光！ 三妖精","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":113.22999999999999,"end":116.22999999999999,"text":"SAY YA! SAY YA! SAY YA! SAY YA! はーーーーーっ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":118.21000000000001,"end":121.21000000000001,"text":"体くたくた潮時 仕掛けカラクリ退散退散！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":124.64,"end":127.64,"text":"だけど終わりはしないもん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":127.8,"end":130.8,"text":"まだ世のために戦います！ 1、2の、そい、SOY！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":130.92,"end":133.92,"text":"ゆらゆらまだ行かないで 儚き夢共にあろう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":137.24,"end":140.24,"text":"あたしらが最強 思い知らせ 最高の友よ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":143.84,"end":146.84,"text":"さあ、開戦！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":147.34,"end":147.92000000000002,"text":"いざ！舞い忍ぶ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":147.92000000000002,"end":150.92000000000002,"text":"三妖精YA! SAY YA! SAY YA!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":151.77,"end":154.77,"text":"ぐるぐる叫べ！ 舞い散れ乙女！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":154.98,"end":157.98,"text":"三妖精YA! SAY YA! SAY YA!（SAY YA！嗚呼）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":158.66,"end":161.5,"text":"いざ世の為","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":161.5,"end":164.5,"text":"ちらゆらほらひら 行け三妖精！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":166.57,"end":169.57,"text":"せーのでよいよいよい せーのでぷいぷいぷい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":169.66,"end":172.66,"text":"せーのでほいほいほい せーのでちゃちゃ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":172.79,"end":175.79,"text":"妖精の掟！チルノなんかに負けたやつは即破門！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":175.84,"end":178.84,"text":"せーのでよいよいよい せーのでぷいぷいぷい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":178.92000000000002,"end":181.92000000000002,"text":"妖精の掟！あたし達妖精の力を思い知らせよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":182.33,"end":185.33,"text":"せーのでよいよいよい せーのでぷいぷいぷい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":185.89,"end":188.48,"text":"一妖精！二妖精！三妖精！合わせて！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":188.48,"end":191.48,"text":"妖精大戦争 やーーーー！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":196.65,"end":199.65,"text":"三妖精YA! SAY YA! SAY YA!（SAY YA）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":200.07,"end":202.55,"text":"ぐるぐる叫べ！ 一気に叩け！（叩け！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":202.55,"end":205.55,"text":"さあ、行こう あたしたちの戦いへと（行こう）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":206.04,"end":209.04,"text":"ちらゆらほらひら いざ挑め！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":209.11,"end":212.11,"text":"活気上げろ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":214.46,"end":216.91,"text":"三妖精YA! SAY YA! SAY YA!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":216.91,"end":217.87,"text":"（戦い挑め 進め！進め！攻めて叩け！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":217.87,"end":220.24,"text":"ぐるぐる叫べ！ 一気に叩け！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":220.24,"end":223.24,"text":"三妖精YA! SAY YA! SAY YA!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":224.07999999999998,"end":227.02,"text":"いざ攻め時 これが勝利の戦だ（舞い散れ）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":227.02,"end":230.02,"text":"あたしら最強 あたしら三